==Match==

===Summary===
[[file:Argentina v checoslovaq 1958.jpg|thumb|Argentina's left wing Osvaldo Cruz on the attack]]
The Europeans quickly took control of the match and in the 8th minute defender [[Milan Dvořák]] scored the first goal with a shot from outside the area. At 17' the Czechs scored through [[Zdeněk Zikán]] after a failed rejection by [[Francisco Lombardo]]. At the end of the first half, at 40', Zikán scored again.

Already in the second half the South Americans tried to close the gap. Thus, at 65' [[Oreste Corbatta|Orestes Omar Corbatta]] made it 1-3 through a penalty. However, four minutes later [[Jiří Feureisl]] scored the fourth goal. Then [[Václav Hovorka]] would score twice, at 82' and 89', making the final score 6 to 1.

